     \n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</header>\n\n    <!--[if lte IE 8]>\n<style>\n    body > * {\n        display: none !important;\n    }\n\n    body .no-support {\n        display: block !important;\n    }\n</style>\n\n<article class=\"no-support\">\n    <h4>Unfortunately the Kiln Theatre website is not accessible via the browser you're currently using.</h4>\n    <p>We recommend <a href=\"http://www.whatbrowser.org/intl/en_uk/\">upgrading your browser</a>.</p>\n</article>\n<![endif]-->\n    <main class=\"global-wrap\">\n<section class=\"c-container--padded c-container--title-bar u-red-bg\">\n    <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n        <h3 class=\"c-container-title c-container-title--bar\">Now Showing</h3>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Masthead -->\n<section class=\"masthead pg__masthead pg__masthead--cinema-image c-box-gradient\" style=\"background-image: url('https://d3bz2hz99ijuc5.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/5.png?resize=1990%2C796&gravity');\">\n    <div class=\"h-row h-row--film\">\n        <h1 class=\"pg__title\">Springsteen: Deliver Me From Nowhere</h1>\n        <h2>31 Oct - 13 Nov 2025</h2>\n\n                    <ul class=\"h-row__film-info\">\n                                    <li>Directed by Scott Cooper</li>\n                                    <li>Starring Jeremy Allen White, Jeremy Strong, Paul Walter Hauser and Stephen Graham</li>\n                                    <li>112 mins</li>\n                            </ul>\n            </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Book and Trailer Buttons -->\n<section class=\"c-container--padded u-white-bg\">\n    <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n        <ul class=\"c-cinema-book\">\n                            <li><a data-fresco-group=\"trailer\" data-fresco-caption=\"\" class=\"fresco c-btn c-btn--primary\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oQXdM3J33No\">View Trailer</a></li>\n            \n                            <li>\n                    <a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/whats-on/springsteen-deliver-me-from-nowhere/#book\" class=\"c-btn c-btn--primary c-btn--book-film \">\n                        Book Now                    </a>\n                </li>\n                    </ul>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Introduction -->\n    <section class=\"c-container--padded u-white-bg\">\n        <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"c-col-txt\">\n                <p>Bruce Springsteen has redefined rock and roll several times in his storied career. This biopic from <i>Crazy Heart</i> director Scott Cooper hones in on a phoenix-like moment in The Boss’s life, as played by <i>The Bear</i>’s Jeremy Allen White. The weight of stardom was heavy upon New Jersey’s brightest son when he left the tour of <i>The River</i>, suicidal and strung out. Holing himself up, he solo recorded one of his bleakest records, an acoustic plunge into the black-hearted soul of America, one that teed him up for <em>Born in the USA</em>&#8216;s majesty.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></p>\n<p>The story of the making of <i>Nebraska</i> is far from the average biopic rise to stardom. Instead, it’s a compelling tale of artistic reinvention and reckoning with the value of fame once it&#8217;s been attained. With a terrific supporting cast of Jeremy Strong, Mark Maron and Stephen Graham, this is poignant stuff whether you’re a devotee of Springsteen or not.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </section>\n\n<!-- Construkt -->\n\n<!-- Films -->\n    <section class=\"c-container--padded c-container--center-title u-white-bg film-book\" id=\"book\">\n        <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"c-film-bookings c-film-bookings--single\">\n                <h3 class=\"c-container-title c-container-title--bar\">Book Now</h3>\n                                    <div class=\"c-booking-single\">\n                        <ul class=\"c-single-performance\">\n                              