/div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"global-header__rhs\">\n                <div class=\"global-header__menu-button\">\n            <div class=\"hamburger\">\n                <span></span>\n                <span></span>\n                <span></span>\n                <span></span>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"global-header__button-text active\">Menu</p>\n            <p class=\"global-header__button-text\">Close</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"global-header__navigation\">\n                            <ul id=\"menu-main-menu-primary-navigation\" class=\"o-nav global-header__nav global-header__nav--primary\"><li id=\"menu-item-21228\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-21228\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/whats-on/\">What’s On</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-23586\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-23586\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/cinema-listings/\">Cinema Listings</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-608\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-608\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/give/\">Give</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-1946\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-1946\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/creative-engagement/\">Creative Engagement</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-35321\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-35321\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/our-story/hire/\">Hires</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-23505\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-23505\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/kiln-card/\">Kiln Card</a></li>\n</ul>            \n                            <ul id=\"menu-main-menu-secondary-nav\" class=\"o-nav global-header__nav global-header__nav--secondary\"><li id=\"menu-item-21712\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-21712\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/your-visit/\">Your Visit</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-14318\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-14318\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/your-visit/access/\">Access</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-21931\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-21931\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/how-to-get-here/food-and-drink/\">Food and Drink</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-14316\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-14316\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/our-story/\">Our Story</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-19804\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-19804\"><a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/our-story/jobs/\">Our Job Opportunities</a></li>\n</ul>            \n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</header>\n\n    <!--[if lte IE 8]>\n<style>\n    body > * {\n        display: none !important;\n    }\n\n    body .no-support {\n        display: block !important;\n    }\n</style>\n\n<article class=\"no-support\">\n    <h4>Unfortunately the Kiln Theatre website is not accessible via the browser you're currently using.</h4>\n    <p>We recommend <a href=\"http://www.whatbrowser.org/intl/en_uk/\">upgrading your browser</a>.</p>\n</article>\n<![endif]-->\n    <main class=\"global-wrap\">\n<section class=\"c-container--padded c-container--title-bar u-red-bg\">\n    <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n        <h3 class=\"c-container-title c-container-title--bar\">Now Showing</h3>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Masthead -->\n<section class=\"masthead pg__masthead pg__masthead--cinema-image c-box-gradient\" style=\"background-image: url('https://d3bz2hz99ijuc5.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/8-1.png?resize=1990%2C796&gravity');\">\n    <div class=\"h-row h-row--film\">\n        <h1 class=\"pg__title\">The Mastermind</h1>\n        <h2>07 Nov - 12 Nov 2025</h2>\n\n                    <ul class=\"h-row__film-info\">\n                                    <li>Directed by Kelly Reichardt</li>\n                                    <li>Starring Josh O'Connor, Alana Haim, Hope Davis and John Magaro</li>\n                                    <li>110 mins</li>\n                            </ul>\n            </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Book and Trailer Buttons -->\n<section class=\"c-container--padded u-white-bg\">\n    <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n        <ul class=\"c-cinema-book\">\n                            <li><a data-fresco-group=\"trailer\" data-fresco-caption=\"\" class=\"fresco c-btn c-btn--primary\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/AWokrf6yeEU\">View Trailer</a></li>\n            \n                            <li>\n                    <a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/whats-on/the-mastermind/#book\" class=\"c-btn c-btn--primary c-btn--book-film \">\n                        Book Now                    </a>\n                </li>\n                    </ul>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Introduction -->\n    <section class=\"c-container--padded u-white-bg\">\n        <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"c-col-txt\">\n                <p>From the director of <em>Meek&#8217;s Cutoff </em>and<em> First Cow</em> comes this inspired new take on the heist film. James (Josh O’Connor) is an art school dropout, sponging off his parents, galling his wife (Alana Haim) and believing his genius will surely grant him universal acclaim, in time. In the meanwhile, he hires some hoods to make an art theft. But James is far from a mastermind, and he soon finds himself perilously out of his depth.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></p>\n<p>Kelly Reichardt, one of modern cinema’s most patient yet impactful filmmakers, adds another jewel to her glittering pile with this film, following modern classics such as <i>Old Joy, Wendy &amp; Lucy </i>and <i>Showing Up</i>. O’Connor is superb, in a performance that sits closely besides <i>La Chimera</i>. What Reichardt drains out in cliché from the heist film, she adds back in with felt tension, the spark of real life. This is a slow burn portrait of a man spiralling, gripping to the last frame because of its fully realised characters.</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </section>\n\n<!-- Construkt -->\n\n<!-- Films -->\n    <section class=\"c-container--padded c-container--center-title u-white-bg film-book\" id=\"book\">\n        <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"c-film-bookings c-film-bookings--single\">\n                <h3 class=\"c-container-title c-container-title--bar\">Book Now</h3>\n                                    <div class=\"c-booking-single\">\n                        <ul class=\"c-single-performance\">\n                                                            <li class=\"instance \">\n                                    <div class=\"c-single-performance__date-wrapper\">\n                                        <div class=\"c-film-booking__date\">\n                                            Friday 7th November                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                                                        <a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/whats-on/the-mastermind/book/778049\" class=\"c-btn c-btn--primary \">\n                                                    3.30PM\n                                                                                                    </a>\n                                </li>\n                                                            <li class=\"instance \">\n                                    <div class=\"c-single-performance__date-wrapper\">\n                                        <div class=\"c-film-booking__date\">\n                                            Friday 7th November                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                                                        <a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/whats-on/the-mastermind/book/778249\" class=\"c-btn c-btn--primary \">\n                                                    8.30PM\n                                                                                                    </a>\n                                </li>\n                                                    </ul>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"c-booking-single\">\n                        <ul class=\"c-single-performance\">\n                                                            <li class=\"instance \">\n                                    <div class=\"c-single-performance__date-wrapper\">\n                                        <div class=\"c-film-booking__date\">\n                                            Saturday 8th November                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                                                        <a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/whats-on/the-mastermind/book/778449\" class=\"c-btn c-btn--primary \">\n                                                    1.00PM\n                                                                                                    </a>\n                                </li>\n                                                            <li class=\"instance \">\n                                    <div class=\"c-single-performance__date-wrapper\">\n                                        <div class=\"c-film-booking__date\">\n                                            Saturday 8th November                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                                                        <a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/whats-on/the-mastermind/book/778849\" class=\"c-btn c-btn--primary \">\n                                                    6.00PM\n                                                                                                    </a>\n                                </li>\n                                                    </ul>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"c-booking-single\">\n                        <ul class=\"c-single-performance\">\n                                                            <li class=\"instance \">\n                                    <div class=\"c-single-performance__date-wrapper\">\n                                        <div class=\"c-film-booking__date\">\n                                            Tuesday 11th November                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                                                        <a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/whats-on/the-mastermind/book/778650\" class=\"c-btn c-btn--primary \">\n                                                    5.30PM\n                                                                                                    </a>\n                                </li>\n                                                    </ul>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"c-booking-single\">\n                        <ul class=\"c-single-performance\">\n                                                            <li class=\"instance \">\n                                    <div class=\"c-single-performance__date-wrapper\">\n                                        <div class=\"c-film-booking__date\">\n                                            Wednesday 12th November                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                                                        <a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/whats-on/the-mastermind/book/779049\" class=\"c-btn c-btn--primary \">\n                                                    11.00AM\