nt;\n    }\n\n    body .no-support {\n        display: block !important;\n    }\n</style>\n\n<article class=\"no-support\">\n    <h4>Unfortunately the Kiln Theatre website is not accessible via the browser you're currently using.</h4>\n    <p>We recommend <a href=\"http://www.whatbrowser.org/intl/en_uk/\">upgrading your browser</a>.</p>\n</article>\n<![endif]-->\n    <main class=\"global-wrap\">\n<section class=\"c-container--padded c-container--title-bar u-red-bg\">\n    <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n        <h3 class=\"c-container-title c-container-title--bar\">Now Showing</h3>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Masthead -->\n<section class=\"masthead pg__masthead pg__masthead--cinema-image c-box-gradient\" style=\"background-image: url('https://d3bz2hz99ijuc5.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/9.png?resize=1990%2C796&gravity');\">\n    <div class=\"h-row h-row--film\">\n        <h1 class=\"pg__title\">Nuremberg</h1>\n        <h2>21 Nov - 27 Nov 2025</h2>\n\n                    <ul class=\"h-row__film-info\">\n                                    <li>Directed by James Vanderbilt</li>\n                                    <li>Starring Russell Crowe Rami Malek Leo Woodall John Slattery</li>\n                                    <li>148 mins</li>\n                            </ul>\n            </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Book and Trailer Buttons -->\n<section class=\"c-container--padded u-white-bg\">\n    <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n        <ul class=\"c-cinema-book\">\n                            <li><a data-fresco-group=\"trailer\" data-fresco-caption=\"\" class=\"fresco c-btn c-btn--primary\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/76N-wgzj8vs\">View Trailer</a></li>\n            \n                            <li>\n                    <a href=\"https://kilntheatre.com/whats-on/nuremberg/#book\" class=\"c-btn c-btn--primary c-btn--book-film \">\n                        Book Now                    </a>\n                </li>\n                    </ul>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Introduction -->\n    <section class=\"c-container--padded u-white-bg\">\n        <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"c-col-txt\">\n                <p>Russell Crowe and Rami Malek face off in this gripping courtroom drama that exposes new light on one of World War II&#8217;s most infamous aftershocks. Awaiting trial for war crimes, Hermann Goring (Crowe) is attended by psychiatrist David M. Kelley (Malek), whose official charge is to prevent suicide before the Reich’s top brass are brought to justice. But Kelley wants to probe the mindset that caused such horror, and so begins a gripping game of psychological cat and mouse.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></p>\n<p>Writer/director James Vanderbilt &#8211; who wrote David Fincher’s <i>Zodiac</i> &#8211; has crafted a strikingly alive historical drama, in which the eventual destination never feels like a fait accompli, but a compelling moral maze that has unsettling resonances with the times we are living through.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </section>\n\n<!-- Construkt -->\n\n<!-- Films -->\n    <section class=\"c-container--padded c-container--center-title u-white-bg film-book\" id=\"book\">\n        <div class=\"max-width-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"c-film-bookings c-film-bookings--single\">\n                <h3 class=\"c-container-title c-container-title--bar\">Book Now</h3>\n                                    <div class=\"c-booking-single\">\n                        <ul class=\"c-single-performance\">\n                                                            <li class=\"instance \">\n                                    <div class=\"c-single-performance__date-wrapper\">\n                                        <div class=\"c-film-booking__date\">\n                                            Friday 21st November                                        </div>\n                            